!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class1/parser/invalid/a-dependent-type-is-no-data-form-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/parser-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "§7.4, §7.5"
  description: """
    A token with a postfix `!` is no data form. `kind!` is the schema grammar's sugar for a dependent field's type
    ([TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2) and has no place in the data grammar, so here `kind` is a token and the `!` adjacent to it
    breaks the separation rule: the document does not parse.
    """
  error: { category: parser }
}
